# zram swap for "Memory extension" = 8 GB. Picked by init.tb520fu.zram.rc from
# persist.sys.tb520fu.vram_gb (set by TB710FUParts). zram itself is always 50%
# of RAM like Pixel (hardware/google/pixel mm/fstab.zram.50p); the extension is
# a writeback file on /data (fs_mgr: /data/per_boot/zram_swap), flushed by the
# framework ZramWriteback job (config_zramWriteback).
#<src>            <mnt_point> <type> <mnt_flags> <fs_mgr_flags>
/dev/block/zram0  none        swap   defaults    zramsize=50%,max_comp_streams=8,zram_backingdev_size=8G
